<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oryx EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oryx EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Morgan Fuller Capital Corp said it was raising its 1997 fiscal net income estimate for Oryx Technology Corp to $1.5 million from $800,000 based primarily on stronger-than-expected power operating results.</p>
<p>-Morgan reiterated its buy recommendation.</p>
</text>
